  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $y=0$ and then evaluate the absolute values before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|2y+3{|}^{3}-|y+2| & = \\\\ |2(0)+3{|}^{3}-|0+2| & = \\\\ |0+3{|}^{3}-|0+2| & = \\\\ |3{|}^{3}-|2| & = \\\\ {3}^{3}-2 & = \\\\ 27-2 & = \\\\ 25 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
